                              NWChem (excerpt)
    Real energy-bearing lines from NWChem 7.2.3 (water / 3-21G), the direct/
    classic modules, `task mp2 energy` then `task ccsd(t) energy`. Captured on
    Deception 2026-10-07. This family writes "Total <METHOD> energy[:] <value>"
    (Total first; ':' or just whitespace, no "/ hartree") — different wording
    from the TCE module, which is why the parser must handle both. Traps: the
    SCS-* scaled variants, and "Total CCSD+T(CCSD) energy" (the [T], not the
    (T) we want).

